            "summary": "The market has been flat over the last week, but it has shown a 13% rise over the past year, with earnings projected to grow by 14% annually in the coming years. In this context, identifying promising stocks involves looking for those that combine affordability with solid financials. While penny stocks might seem like an outdated term, they remain relevant as they often represent smaller or newer companies offering potential growth opportunities.",
